diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..663730a 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,34 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers a device to be pushed to, using the subscription the browser got from its push service.
+The device then gets a push notification for everything that lands in the user's notification tray.
+Only the current user can subscribe their own devices.
+
+Available when the instance is configured with a VAPID key pair. The public key of that pair is
+what the browser needs to subscribe with; Fizzy renders it on the notification settings page.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | The push service URL the browser handed out |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | The subscription's public key |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | The subscription's auth secret |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/subscriptions/abcdef",
+    "p256dh_key": "BM1G4fV50VfnsLAXOMZNPBAFs0i...",
+    "auth_key": "auS8ybLqRjK_Anqh6eElJA=="
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` on success.
